{"id":"en_the-conqueror-s-return","title":"The Conqueror's Return","titleEn":"The Conqueror's Return","description":"After three years of marriage into the Shen family, Ye Tiance reclaims his true identity. At a classmate's grand opening, Master Hu's marriage proposal and a socialite banquet, he stands firmly behind his wife, Shen Zhuxin, slapping those who mock her, helping the Shen family resolve its difficulties and finally revealing who he really is. That revelation turns Shen Zhuxin into the focus of everyone's attention, and the bond between the couple grows stronger than before. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-conquerors-return/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-conquerors-return/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Hidden Identity","Love After Marriage","Short Drama"],"featured":true,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77bnya/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-conqueror-s-return_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77bnya/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-conqueror-s-return_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77bnya/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-conqueror-s-return_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77bnya/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-conqueror-s-return_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77bnya/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed